{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261015/photo/bkn-20261015193006066-1015_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261015193006\"/><p>蘇堤達親自駕駛波音737-800專機。</p><p>泰國王后蘇堤達（Queen Suthida）再次展現高超飛行技術，周三（14日）親自駕駛波音737-800專機，從曼谷飛抵日本北海道新千歲機場，準備擔任「亞洲女子冰球錦標賽」頒獎嘉賓。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T11:39:59.059486+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:30:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T13:58:13.482728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:37:38.630790+00:00","content_hash":"8d264c608be90281b079cd1efe296dd65b78cc97ea5f428010d37be48ea14cd0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}